WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Faisal stays calm and gets the facts.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.900
Faisal: We'll find him. What's his name? How old? What is he wearing?

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.900
Narrator: Age, clothes, where and when.

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:15.200
Faisal: Boy, 7, white thobe, short black hair. Last seen by Kiosk 4, two minutes ago.

5
00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:18.708
Narrator: A quick look round - then the radio.

6
00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:23.608
Faisal: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22 … north concourse, Kiosk 4. Lost child.

7
00:00:23.908 --> 00:00:30.308
Faisal: Boy, about 7, white thobe, short black hair. Last seen two minutes ago. I'm with the mother. Over.

8
00:00:30.508 --> 00:00:34.908
Narrator: Notice he describes the boy but keeps his name off the open channel.

9
00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:37.208
Narrator: His supervisor arrives and takes over.

10
00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:42.175
Narrator: Faisal goes back to his post - his area still needs him.

11
00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.075
Narrator: Twelve minutes later, the family are together again.
